[PrintTextModified Text:偶尔配合蕾雅一次，或许也不错。<br>我没想太多，回握住了她的手。|#0204Bad01_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_19_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Surprised1,ArmR2

[PrintTextModified Text:！！|#0204Bad01_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅猛地抬起头，露出吃惊的神情。|#0204Bad01_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:明明是她自己先摆出求爱的架势的，<br>大概是以为我会无视她吧。|#0204Bad01_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Flushed1,ArmR2

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗，你……？|#0204Bad01_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她凑近我，<br>仿佛想从我眼中看穿我的真意。|#0204Bad01_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:35 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:65 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Flushed1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:……怎么了？<br>不是要去找典狱长吗？|#0204Bad01_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:65,50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊……那就走吧。|#0204Bad01_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她愣了好一阵子，<br>随后带着些许喜悦的笑容点了点头。|#0204Bad01_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我牵起她的手，只是一时心血来潮。<br>其中并无更深的含义。|#0204Bad01_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然而，在我握住她向我伸来的手时，<br>与她目光交汇的瞬间，<br>我却被某种奇妙的感觉席卷。|#0204Bad01_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽说无法用言语清楚地表达……|#0204Bad01_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但那一刻，就像是拼图终于找到了最后一块，<br>就像是卡住的齿轮终于啮合在一起。<br>这一刻，似乎在我和蕾雅之间，产生了某种连结。|#0204Bad01_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:65 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:35 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:得在放风时间结束前，<br>找到典狱长才行。|#0204Bad01_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那就先从监牢内部找起吧。|#0204Bad01_Leia004| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我与蕾雅并肩前行。|#0204Bad01_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

