[PrintTextModified Text:几天后的夜晚。|#0204Bad01_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我像往常一样写下日记。|#0204Bad01_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; さらさらと紙にペンを走らせる書き音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_111 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:1

[PrintTextModified Text:游说典狱长以失败告终。|#0204Bad01_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不论如何恳求它停止魔女审判，<br>那只猫头鹰都毫不理会。|#0204Bad01_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅虽然有些沮丧，<br>但她向我表示了感激。|#0204Bad01_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她说，是因为有我在身边。<br>她说，是我的坚强支撑着她。|#0204Bad01_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:老实说，这种让人牙酸的话真叫人受不了。|#0204Bad01_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可我也是一样的。<br>今天一整天与她同行，终于令我明白。|#0204Bad01_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然我自己绝对说不出这种腻歪话——|#0204Bad01_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但是，在和蕾雅同行的时间里，我的确得到了内心的安稳。<br>有她在我身边，真是太好了。|#0204Bad01_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——写到这里，我放下了笔。|#0204Bad01_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:无意间看到自己的指甲，我痛苦地咬住了嘴唇。|#0204Bad01_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:今早明明才刚剪短的指甲，不知何时已悄然生长。|#0204Bad01_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我不想承认。<br>我自己也出现了魔女化的征兆。|#0204Bad01_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（时间所剩无几了）|#0204Bad01_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:大魔女的线索依旧没有头绪。|#0204Bad01_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:游说典狱长也已失败。|#0204Bad01_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那么，我该怎么办？|#0204Bad01_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm FadeOutDuration:3

[PrintTextModified Text:要怎样才能，拯救大家？|#0204Bad01_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#00000000 Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000ff Duration:1 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
