@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_40_1_Loop IntroBgmPath:Bgm_40_1_Intro Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:又过了几天。|#0204Bad01_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看来时限将近的人，并不止我一个。<br>每个人的精神压力都已接近极限。|#0204Bad01_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就在刚才，亚里沙和其他少女们<br>又为了一点琐事争吵起来。<br>现在杀意一触即发。|#0204Bad01_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:再这样下去，不久后又会发生凶杀案。|#0204Bad01_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这几天，我不断思考。|#0204Bad01_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如何才能拯救她们。<br>到底什么才是她们需要的【救赎】。|#0204Bad01_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:最终，我得出了一个答案。<br>今天，我准备将这个答案向蕾雅分享。|#0204Bad01_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:或许她会……<br>不，几乎可以肯定她会否定我。|#0204Bad01_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但那也无妨。<br>就算孤身一人，我也会完成。|#0204Bad01_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不过，如果蕾雅能与我并肩同行的话——|#0204Bad01_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 野外で近づいてくる足音・1人
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_73 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.5 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,30 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:久等了，希罗。|#0204Bad01_Leia005| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不好意思，突然把你叫出来。<br>我有话想对你说。<br>其实——|#0204Bad01_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#00000000 Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
