[PrintTextModified Text:——蕾雅接受了我的答案。|#0204Bad01_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:紧接着，我们开始了行动。|#0204Bad01_Narrative040| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙死了。<br>米莉亚死了。|#0204Bad01_Narrative041| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉死了。<br>汉娜死了。<br>艾玛也死了。|#0204Bad01_Narrative042| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只剩下我与蕾雅二人。|#0204Bad01_Narrative043| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:阳光温柔洒落在中庭里。<br>我坐在地上，让蕾雅枕着我的膝盖。|#0204Bad01_Narrative044| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:仿佛时间停滞般的宁静笼罩着我们，<br>唯有树影在缓缓摇曳。|#0204Bad01_Narrative045| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我轻抚她柔软的发丝，<br>每当我的手指拂过，<br>她都会像被挠痒似的微微眯起眼睛。|#0204Bad01_Narrative046| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.5 Lazy:false ScenePosition:35,40 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.5 Lazy:false ScenePosition:65,30 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:大家都死了呢。|#0204Bad01_Leia006| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊。都死了。|#0204Bad01_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:目光相交，我们相视而笑。|#0204Bad01_Narrative047| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我……我与蕾雅两人，完成了这一切。|#0204Bad01_Narrative048| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们一起，杀了所有人。|#0204Bad01_Narrative049| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为了将她们从大魔女的诅咒中解放。|#0204Bad01_Narrative050| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以，必须杀死她们。|#0204Bad01_Narrative051| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这，就是我得出的答案。<br>唯一能拯救大家的方法。|#0204Bad01_Narrative052| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们缜密地制定计划，<br>逐一夺走少女们的生命。|#0204Bad01_Narrative053| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是因为蕾雅在我身边才能做到。<br>她既聪明又果断。|#0204Bad01_Narrative054| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以，杀死少女们的过程，<br>比我想像中要容易许多。|#0204Bad01_Narrative055| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这不是其他人能做到的事。<br>唯有我与蕾雅，才能完成。|#0204Bad01_Narrative056| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,40 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅，谢谢你。|#0204Bad01_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我握住她的手。<br>而她轻轻地摇了摇头。|#0204Bad01_Narrative057| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.5 Lazy:false ScenePosition:35,40 IdAndAppearance:Hiro
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.5 Lazy:false ScenePosition:65,30 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:没关系的。|#0204Bad01_Leia007| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:我原以为，你会反对我的计划。|#0204Bad01_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:确实……在听到这个提议时我很震惊。<br>不过，我认为你的想法是对的。|#0204Bad01_Leia008| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:留给我们的救赎，<br>已经只剩下“死”了。|#0204Bad01_Leia009| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:大家都到极限了。<br>……这一点我也一样。|#0204Bad01_Leia010| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她露出一丝自嘲的微笑。<br>接着，像是在告解自己的罪行般继续说道。|#0204Bad01_Narrative058| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……我曾经对艾玛怀有杀意。<br>一开始是源于嫉妒。|#0204Bad01_Leia011| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:嫉妒？对艾玛？|#0204Bad01_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯。<br>因为，你总是那么在意艾玛啊。|#0204Bad01_Leia012| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:如果那样继续下去，<br>就算今天我们没有这么做，我迟早也会杀了她。|#0204Bad01_Leia013| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:！|#0204Bad01_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我啊，我想让希罗，<br>只看着我一个人。|#0204Bad01_Leia014| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅的语气似带着一丝玩笑，<br>但眼神却无比认真。|#0204Bad01_Narrative059| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Flushed1

[PrintTextModified Text:我不知该作何反应。<br>这时，她再次开口说道。|#0204Bad01_Narrative060| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以我其实很高兴。<br>你愿意告诉我。<br>还愿意选我成为你的共犯。|#0204Bad01_Leia015| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊……原来如此。<br>我能和魔女化抵抗到最后，<br>或许正是因为这个原因吧。|#0204Bad01_Leia016| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:因为希罗，选择了我。|#0204Bad01_Leia017| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅深深凝视着我。<br>她的双瞳，正闪耀着宝石般的光芒。|#0204Bad01_Narrative061| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她的眼睛让我明白，留给我们的时间已经不多了。<br>那并非比喻，她的瞳孔正逐渐硬化，<br>如同真正的宝石。|#0204Bad01_Narrative062| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这应该是药的副作用。<br>蕾雅饮下的药，<br>正是藏在监牢中的【杀死魔女的药】。|#0204Bad01_Narrative063| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们曾经立下誓言。<br>当一切结束之时，便亲手让帷幕落下。|#0204Bad01_Narrative064| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……谢谢你。|#0204Bad01_Leia018| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Cry1

[PrintTextModified Text:再等等我。<br>我还有话，想对你说……|#0204Bad01_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:应该道谢的，是我才对……|#0204Bad01_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然只是短短的时间，但我真的很高兴能与你同行。<br>能在这监牢中遇见你，真的太好了……|#0204Bad01_Hiro012| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那些羞于启齿的话语，如今终于倾泻而出。|#0204Bad01_Narrative065| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:话音刚落。|#0204Bad01_Narrative066| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅已悄然没了呼吸。|#0204Bad01_Narrative067| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不知她是否听见了我的心声——|#0204Bad01_Narrative068| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

