[PrintTextModified Text:当我牵起她的手的那一刻。|#0204Bad01_Narrative071| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:似乎感受到了我和蕾雅之间的某种连结。<br>就像是拼图终于找到了最后一块。<br>就像是卡住的齿轮终于啮合在一起。一种奇妙的感受。|#0204Bad01_Narrative072| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如今我终于明白。<br>那就是悟到自己正与命中注定的另一半<br>相遇的瞬间。|#0204Bad01_Narrative073| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但如今，一切都已失去。|#0204Bad01_Narrative074| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我已经永远失去了名为莲见蕾雅的另一半。|#0204Bad01_Narrative075| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:我也马上就去找你。|#0204Bad01_Hiro013| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我取出药瓶，一口饮尽瓶中液体。<br>与蕾雅喝下的一样——是【杀死魔女的药】。|#0204Bad01_Narrative076| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这样，我应该也能彻底死去吧。|#0204Bad01_Narrative077| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是否死亡回溯的魔法不会再发动，<br>就此迎来终焉呢。|#0204Bad01_Narrative078| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我闭上双眼。|#0204Bad01_Narrative079| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

